Before any Avni reporting work, read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root and follow its golden rules and workflow.
Load the matching `skills/<name>/SKILL.md` for the tool involved, and `playbooks/` for known symptoms.
At the end of every task, record anything new or any correction with `python3 tools/add_learning.py` (see `skills/report-learnings/SKILL.md`).
